            "block_content": "e. No salary credit shall be given for substitute teaching, except as stated above in G.1.d graduate assistantships, or private nursery school or kindergarten teaching unless kindergarten teaching is a part of an elementary school. For teachers being employed for the first time in Orange County, no salary credit shall be given for teaching for any time prior to a teacher being awarded a four-year degree. Substitute teaching as used in this section does not apply to replacement teachers who are under contract with the Board.",
