        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. Teachers shall be paid for zero (0) years of experience until such time as verification for experience is received by the Board. Upon verification of experience any payment of back salary shall be made at the end of the next payroll period. Any salary adjustment for experience credit shall begin with the school year in which the adjustment is made and shall be retroactive to the beginning of that school year.",
