        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. Half-time teaching, work experience related to certification, and military experience shall be combined for salary credit, i.e., two (2) one-half (½) years or two (2) half-time years equals one (1) year of experience. One-half (½) year of experience shall be defined as at least fifty (50) but less than ninety-nine (99) days, fifty (50) of which must be continuous, in any regular school year. Any two half-years to be combined for a year of salary credit must occur within a five-year period.",
